    "body": "I'm fairly confident that this isn't needed in CPython because the GIL can no longer be released during allocation (since it's no longer a point to trigger GC). But on other implementations I think it's better to own the reference to avoid any possibility of a race. I'm also including Limited API as an \"other implementation\" since it's less easy to guess what future versions will do or if another Python implementation will implement it.\r\n\r\nThis is probably fairly minor and unlikely to cause any real issues.",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-05T07:24:00Z",
